{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-learning-rs","title":"深度学习遥感解译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/image-analysis/deep-learning-rs","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"深度学习遥感解译\">深度学习遥感解译</h1><p><a href=\"classification-change-detection\">影像分类与变化检测</a> 里的随机森林靠人工设计的特征工作；深度学习则自己从数据里学特征。这一转变在过去十年彻底重塑了遥感解译——从逐像元分类到端到端语义分割、从单一任务模型到一次预训练通吃多任务的&quot;地球观测基础模型&quot;。2026 年，SAM 2、Prithvi-EO-2.0 等模型让&quot;用一句话从卫星图里框出所有农田&quot;从设想变成工程现实。但遥感影像的尺度多变、波段多于三、标注稀缺等特性，也让深度学习落地远非把自然图像模型搬过来那么简单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>深度学习用多层神经网络从原始像素端到端学习层级特征，省去人工特征工程。在遥感中，卷积神经网络（CNN）擅长捕捉局部空间模式，视觉 Transformer（ViT）擅长建模长程依赖，二者构成主流骨干。任务类型上，遥感深度学习涵盖场景分类（整图一个标签）、语义分割（逐像元分类）、目标检测（框出物体）、变化检测（双时相对比）。</p>\n<p>遥感主要任务与典型模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>场景分类</td>\n<td>整图类别</td>\n<td>土地利用大类</td>\n<td>ResNet、ViT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义分割</td>\n<td>逐像元类别</td>\n<td>地物精细制图</td>\n<td>U-Net、DeepLab、SegFormer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标检测</td>\n<td>边界框</td>\n<td>舰船、飞机、车辆</td>\n<td>YOLO、Faster R-CNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例/提示分割</td>\n<td>物体掩膜</td>\n<td>田块、建筑提取</td>\n<td>Mask R-CNN、SAM 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化检测</td>\n<td>变化掩膜</td>\n<td>城市扩张、灾损</td>\n<td>孪生网络 Siamese</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从经典方法到基础模型的演进路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[人工特征 + 随机森林/SVM] --&gt; B[CNN 端到端学习&lt;br/&gt;U-Net 语义分割]&#10;  B --&gt; C[视觉 Transformer&lt;br/&gt;长程依赖建模]&#10;  C --&gt; D[自监督预训练&lt;br/&gt;海量无标注影像]&#10;  D --&gt; E[地球观测基础模型&lt;br/&gt;Prithvi / SatMAE]&#10;  E --&gt; F[少样本微调&lt;br/&gt;多任务通用]&#10;  C --&gt; G[提示分割 SAM 2&lt;br/&gt;零样本+交互]\">graph TD\n  A[人工特征 + 随机森林/SVM] --&gt; B[CNN 端到端学习&lt;br/&gt;U-Net 语义分割]\n  B --&gt; C[视觉 Transformer&lt;br/&gt;长程依赖建模]\n  C --&gt; D[自监督预训练&lt;br/&gt;海量无标注影像]\n  D --&gt; E[地球观测基础模型&lt;br/&gt;Prithvi / SatMAE]\n  E --&gt; F[少样本微调&lt;br/&gt;多任务通用]\n  C --&gt; G[提示分割 SAM 2&lt;br/&gt;零样本+交互]</pre><h2 id=\"语义分割-遥感的主力任务\">语义分割：遥感的主力任务</h2><p>地物制图本质是逐像元贴标签，这正是语义分割。U-Net 凭借编码器-解码器加跳跃连接的结构，能在下采样捕捉语境的同时靠跳跃连接恢复边界细节，成为遥感分割的事实标准骨干；DeepLab 的空洞卷积、SegFormer 的轻量 Transformer 解码进一步提升了多尺度物体的分割精度。遥感分割的独特挑战在于尺度跨度极大——一张图里既有占几个像元的车辆，也有连绵千像元的农田，模型必须兼顾。</p>\n<p>损失函数的选择对类别极不平衡的遥感任务尤为关键。当目标地物（如滑坡、新增建筑）只占全图极小比例时，普通交叉熵会被背景淹没，常改用 Dice 损失或 Focal 损失。Dice 损失直接优化预测掩膜与真值的重叠度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>Dice</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{Dice}} = 1 - \\frac{2 \\sum_i p_i g_i}{\\sum_i p_i + \\sum_i g_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Dice</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是像元 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的预测概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是真值标签。这类技巧让稀有但重要的地物不被忽视，直接服务于 <a href=\"../applications/disaster-environment\">灾害与环境监测</a> 的小目标提取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"遥感深度学习的特殊性\">遥感深度学习的特殊性</h2><p>把自然图像模型直接搬到遥感会撞上四堵墙。其一，波段多于 RGB：多光谱十余个、高光谱数百个波段，标准三通道预训练权重无法直接吃下，需改造输入层或重新设计。其二，标注稀缺且昂贵：人工标注卫星图需专业知识，远比标注猫狗困难。其三，尺度与分辨率多变：同一模型要处理 0.3 米到 30 米差异巨大的输入。其四，几何与辐射的鲁棒性：跨传感器、跨季节、跨地域的域偏移会让模型在新区域大幅掉点。</p>\n<p>应对这些挑战的技术路线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[遥感深度学习挑战] --&gt; B[波段多于RGB]&#10;  A --&gt; C[标注稀缺]&#10;  A --&gt; D[域偏移]&#10;  B --&gt; E[多光谱输入层改造&lt;br/&gt;波段自适应]&#10;  C --&gt; F[自监督预训练&lt;br/&gt;掩码重建 MAE]&#10;  C --&gt; G[弱监督/合成数据]&#10;  D --&gt; H[域适应/数据增强]&#10;  E --&gt; I[鲁棒遥感模型]&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[遥感深度学习挑战] --&gt; B[波段多于RGB]\n  A --&gt; C[标注稀缺]\n  A --&gt; D[域偏移]\n  B --&gt; E[多光谱输入层改造&lt;br/&gt;波段自适应]\n  C --&gt; F[自监督预训练&lt;br/&gt;掩码重建 MAE]\n  C --&gt; G[弱监督/合成数据]\n  D --&gt; H[域适应/数据增强]\n  E --&gt; I[鲁棒遥感模型]\n  F --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>自监督预训练是破解标注稀缺的关键——用海量无标注影像，让模型通过掩码重建（如 SatMAE、Masked Autoencoder）等任务学到通用表征，再用少量标注样本微调。这与高光谱&quot;高维小样本&quot;困境的解法一脉相承，见 <a href=\"../sensors-platforms/optical-hyperspectral\">光学多光谱与高光谱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基础模型时代\">基础模型时代</h2><p>2026 年遥感最大的范式变化是&quot;地球观测基础模型&quot;（GeoFM）。IBM 与 NASA 联合的 Prithvi-EO-2.0 用海量多时相卫星数据自监督预训练，在洪水制图、作物分类、火烧迹地等下游任务上只需少量微调即达高精度（来源：arXiv Prithvi-EO-2.0）。Meta 的 SAM 2 把&quot;提示分割&quot;带入遥感：给一个框或一个点，模型零样本输出物体掩膜，研究显示在复杂光照与分辨率下用框提示已超越传统 CNN/YOLO 流水线，并被用于 Sentinel-2 田块边界提取等任务（来源：Roboflow、PMC 田块研究、SAM 2 综述）。</p>\n<p>基础模型的意义在于改变了开发范式：过去每个任务从零训练、需大量标注；现在以预训练大模型为底座、少样本微调即可适配新任务、新区域。这大幅降低了遥感 AI 的应用门槛，让 <a href=\"../applications/landcover-agriculture\">土地覆盖与农业监测</a>、<a href=\"../applications/climate-carbon\">气候与碳监测</a> 等领域能更快迭代。但也要清醒：基础模型的偏差、可解释性、对罕见地物的可靠性仍是开放问题，业务部署前的精度评价（见 <a href=\"classification-change-detection\">影像分类与变化检测</a>）一步都不能省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>深度学习从数据自学层级特征，取代人工特征工程；CNN 捕捉局部、Transformer 建模长程依赖。</li>\n<li>语义分割（U-Net、SegFormer）是遥感制图主力；类别极不平衡时改用 Dice/Focal 损失突出稀有地物。</li>\n<li>遥感落地有四堵墙：波段多于 RGB、标注稀缺、尺度多变、跨域偏移，需输入改造与自监督预训练应对。</li>\n<li>自监督预训练（掩码重建）用海量无标注影像学通用表征，破解标注稀缺，呼应高光谱小样本解法。</li>\n<li>2026 年进入基础模型时代：Prithvi-EO-2.0、SAM 2 以预训练底座 + 少样本微调适配多任务，但可靠性仍需精度评价把关。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深度学习遥感解译","id":"深度学习遥感解译"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语义分割：遥感的主力任务","id":"语义分割-遥感的主力任务"},{"level":2,"text":"遥感深度学习的特殊性","id":"遥感深度学习的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"基础模型时代","id":"基础模型时代"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"影像分类与变化检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/image-analysis/classification-change-detection"},"next":{"title":"土地覆盖与农业监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/remote-sensing/applications/landcover-agriculture"}}